{
  "id": "fox-firefox-angles",
  "name": "Firefox angles",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "Recover with Firefox at the angle each position needs.",
  "why": "Firefox goes in one straight line at the angle held when it launches, and leaves Fox helpless after it. From each position only some angles reach the ledge or the stage; the rest end below the stage or short of it, and the stock is lost.",
  "tutorial": {
    "what": "Firefox charges for {42} frames, then launches on frame {43} in the direction the control stick holds on that frame. The angle has to point at the ledge or the stage from where the charge ends.",
    "expect": "Each Firefox is judged when Fox grabs the ledge or lands, or when he has missed: the angle he launched at, and whether he reached. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against the launch frame.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          1
        ],
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0.0,
          1.0
        ],
        "frame": 30,
        "hold": 20
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: up-B. The charge",
      "16": "Frame {16}: Fox starts to sink",
      "43": "Frame {43}: launched straight up",
      "73": "Frame {73}: the travel is over. Helpless"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Charge and launch",
        "text": [
          "Up-B charges for {42} frames. For the first {15} Fox holds still in the air; for the rest he sinks slowly, about {6} units in all.",
          "On frame {43} the game reads the control stick: Fox faces the way it points and launches at its angle, {0} degrees toward where he faces, {90} straight up. Each axis of the stick reads as 0 up to {22} of its {80} steps from the centre, so a stick within about {16} degrees of level launches level, one within about {16} degrees of vertical launches straight up, and so does neutral.",
          "He travels {30} frames in a straight line, {81.5} units, slowing from {3.8} units a frame, then falls helpless: only the ledge or the stage ends the fall."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0.94,
                  0.342
                ],
                "frame": 30,
                "hold": 20
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: up-B. The charge",
              "16": "Frame {f}: sinking slowly",
              "43": "Frame {43}: the stick is read. Launch",
              "44": "Frame {f}: travel",
              "73": "Frame {f}: helpless"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  15
                ],
                "words": "Charge: Fox holds still",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  16,
                  42
                ],
                "words": "Charge: hold the angle",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  43,
                  43
                ],
                "words": "Launch: the stick's angle now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  44,
                  72
                ],
                "words": "Travel",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  73,
                  110
                ],
                "words": "Helpless",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Far out: a shallow angle",
        "scenario": 0,
        "text": [
          "Fox falls until the charge starts, so up-B at once: the angle a position needs changes with every frame of the fall.",
          "From far out and above the stage, the stage is ahead: aim between {10} degrees down and {30} up. Steeper, the travel goes up instead of across and Fox falls short."
        ],
